:: StoryTitle
Park Walk

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "3F0B6C1E-8A2D-4E57-9C61-2B7D4A9E0F13",
  "start": "Gate",
  "tag-colors": {"encounter": "green", "ending": "blue"}
}

:: Gate [start]
@id gate
--
The park gate creaks open. The dog pulls toward the pond.

[[Go to the pond->Pond]]
[[Take the long path->Long path]] @set energy -= 10

:: Pond [encounter]
@id pond
@set excitement += 20
--
Ducks. Many ducks.

[[Hold the leash tight->Calm down]] @set excitement -= 30, bond -= 5
[[Throw a treat->Treat]] @cost treats 1 @when treats >= 1
[[Let go->Splash]] @when excitement > 150

:: Long path
@id long_path
--
Trees, shade and one interesting stick.

[[Pick up the stick->Fetch]]
[[Head home->Home happy]]

:: Calm down
@id calm_down
--
The dog sits. It does not look happy about it.

[[Head home->Home grumpy]]

:: Treat
@id treat
@set bond += 10
--
The treat wins. The ducks lose.

[[Head home->Home happy]]

:: Fetch
@id fetch
@when energy >= 20
--
Three throws. Then a nap under a tree.

:: Home happy [ending]
@id home_happy
@end
--
A good walk.

:: Home grumpy [ending]
@id home_grumpy
@end
--
A walk. Technically.

:: Loud bang [interrupt]
@id loud_bang
@when noise >= 80
--
A car backfires. The dog freezes, then tugs toward home.

[[Kneel and wait->@return]] @set excitement -= 20, bond += 5 @hint "Takes a moment"
[[Head home now->Home grumpy]] @set bond *= 0.5 @hint "Keeps half the bond"
